Package: hwall
Version: @VERSION@-1+@SUITE@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: pulpul-s <pulpul-s@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Depends: libc6, libgcc-s1, libgtk-4-1 (>= 4.8)
Recommends: lm-sensors, hwdata, ethtool, smartmontools, nvme-cli, dmidecode, pkexec
Description: Linux hardware inventory and live sensor monitor
 HWall provides GTK 4 and terminal interfaces for hardware inventory,
 live sensors, alerts, history, and storage health information.
